Important parameters
Parameter	Purpose
n_components	Number of Gaussian distributions
covariance_type	Cluster covariance structure
n_init	Number of initializations
reg_covar	Small regularization added to covariance diagonal
random_state	Reproducibility

Four covariance types:
- full: Each component has its own full covariance matrix.
- tied: All components share one full covariance matrix.
- diag: Each component has its own diagonal covariance matrix.
- spherical: Each component has one variance value.
Important: predict_proba() returns soft membership probabilities, while predict() returns the most likely component label.
